# Braided sphericalization from actual rigid and finite semisimple categories

This aggregate imports the constructed category of actual Radford square
roots, its actual braided rigid monoidal and spherical pivotal structures,
its finite semisimple skeleton and dominant forgetful tensor functor, its
canonical negative transparent generator, and the fully faithful pivotal
section associated to an existing prescribed spherical structure.

